* A double-quoted macro argument with escaped quotes ("\"ABCD: \"" for a dc.b \1 in the body):
* r68 takes \" as ", so the argument is a string for the body's dc.b, in as's quotes '...'
* (as crashed on the backslashes once: Internal error, Segmentation fault).
* fixed: 39cc40d 2026-10-11 r68togas: escaped quotes in a quoted macro argument
* expect text: 06414243 443a2002 27274e71
STR	MACRO
	  dc.b	Length\@
Start\@ equ *
	  dc.b	\1
Length\@	set	 *-Start\@
		ENDM
 psect macro_string_arg,0,0,0,0,0
T1	STR	"\"ABCD: \""
T2	STR	"\"''\""
 nop
 ends
